# P4 (wave 2 step 1/3): does an npc that walked up to the hero start a dialog of the scripts? Hilda and Maleth
# have important greetings waiting, Lobart has none (it needs ZS_TALK). bench.log: "dialog started: <npc>".
# Each one in its own run of the hero: a dialog holds the player.
cheat god
set time 10 0
goto NW_FARM1_OUT_01
wait 4000
watch BAU_950_LOBART
rec lobart
come BAU_950_LOBART
wait 15000
nearby 800
rec hilda
come BAU_951_HILDA
wait 20000
nearby 800
